    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Mole Digging&quot; is a simple yet profound puzzle game where you control a mole to dig through the ground in a single stroke.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the start of the game, a grid appears on the surface, and the mole sets off from the &quot;START&quot; flag. You must guide the mole to pass through the flags labeled &quot;1&quot; and &quot;2&quot; in order, digging through every tile in a single, unbroken path. Branching paths or missed tiles are not allowed. It's a straightforward yet deep puzzle that requires logical thinking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress through the stages, the structures become more complex, and the positions of the flags and the shapes of the tiles increase the difficulty of finding the correct route. The sense of accomplishment when you dig through all the ground using intuition and trial-and-error is exceptional.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game, which once captivated many players on smartphones, is now available on Steam with beautifully refined graphics and smooth controls! Compatible with mouse and keyboard for comfortable operation, allowing you to tackle stage challenges more thoroughly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Intuitive and profound single-stroke puzzle gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Different routes and mechanisms for each stage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Route constraints and area structures that stimulate thinking</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A relaxing yet thoughtful gameplay experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Renewed visuals and PC-optimized UI design</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you dig through all the ground?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's start the mole's adventure in &quot;Mole Digging&quot;!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Mole Digging&quot; is a simple yet profound puzzle game where you control a mole to dig through the ground in a single stroke.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the start of the game, a grid appears on the surface, and the mole sets off from the &quot;START&quot; flag. You must guide the mole to pass through the flags labeled &quot;1&quot; and &quot;2&quot; in order, digging through every tile in a single, unbroken path. Branching paths or missed tiles are not allowed. It's a straightforward yet deep puzzle that requires logical thinking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress through the stages, the structures become more complex, and the positions of the flags and the shapes of the tiles increase the difficulty of finding the correct route. The sense of accomplishment when you dig through all the ground using intuition and trial-and-error is exceptional.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game, which once captivated many players on smartphones, is now available on Steam with beautifully refined graphics and smooth controls! Compatible with mouse and keyboard for comfortable operation, allowing you to tackle stage challenges more thoroughly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Intuitive and profound single-stroke puzzle gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Different routes and mechanisms for each stage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Route constraints and area structures that stimulate thinking</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A relaxing yet thoughtful gameplay experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Renewed visuals and PC-optimized UI design</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you dig through all the ground?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's start the mole's adventure in &quot;Mole Digging&quot;!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
